3e Returned: item1 (Clock: {0: 1})\r\n\r\n[Client] Update write:\r\nWrite 'item1,item2' handled by Node 0, replicated to 2 nodes. VClock: {0: 2}\r\n\r\n[Client] Concurrent writes (Partition):\r\nWrite 'item1,item2,item3A' handled by Node 0, replicated to 2 nodes. VClock: {0: 3}\r\nWrite 'item1,item2,item3B' handled by Node 2, replicated to 2 nodes. VClock: {0: 2, 2: 1}\r\n\r\n[Client] Read with conflict:\r\n  -\u003e Returned: item1,item2,item3B (Clock: {0: 2, 2: 1})\r\nPASS: All tests completed successfully.\r\n"}}}
